1_26_The Test of the Oracle_As you approach the Oracle, it responds with a riddle: “I am treacherous, deep, and vast. Many have crossed me, both now and in the past. What am I?”_Ocean_2_Poseidon, Njord, and Tiamat are deities associated with this entity._Atlantic, Pacific, and Indian are several notable examples of this kind of entity.
2_22_The Shaman's Seal_A magic seal has been placed on the entrance to Tartarus. As you approach, the Shaman speaks: “I have long aided humanity to fight the rising odds; I am the weapon that can kill the Gods. What am I?”_Spear_2_Odin’s Gungnir is this type of weapon._A trident is a three-pronged variant of this weapon.
3_28_The Gates of the Acropolis_A magic seal has been placed on the grand entrance to the Acropolis. In order for you to progress to the next area, they must answer the following riddle: “I am the original Fire, the source of all Light. When at last I extinguish, an unending night. What am I?”_The Sun_2_Quetzalcóatl, Ra, and Helios are deities associated with this entity._This entity is approximately 93 million miles away from the Earth.
4_12_The Archmage's Seal_In the archives, the exit from Floor 2 leading to the top has been sealed by some magic. The door to the top floor of the archives is glowing with a menacing aura, and there appear to be 2 snakes wrapped around the door handles. One moves towards you and speaks: “I am the final rest, the end of the line. Should you reject or embrace me, the choice is not thine. What am I?”_Death_2_Hades and Anubis are Gods associated with this concept._Modern depictions of characters associated with this entity will often wear a black cloak and wield a scythe.
5_25_Unlit Sconce_There are two sconces on either side of a door; one is lit while the other is not. The door is sealed shut by some magic, preventing you from entering the Forest on Oracle Island. When you approach, a message appears on the door: “The door is sealed shut by some magic. There are two sconces on either side of the door; one is lit while the other is not. What will you do?”_Light_2_The two sides must match_The answer is halfway in front of you.
6_4_Vulcan's Mechanism_In the Mines entrance, you see a lock placed on the door leading North to the quarry. It is an elaborate and ornate mechanism of some kind placed by Vulcan, patron God of Blacksmiths. As you approach, you hear: “If you seek to move forward on your journey, first you must complete this mental tourney. I wait in the shadows; my body is curled. When the time is right, I shall devour the World. What am I?”_Snake_2_I caused the fall of man in the Garden of Eden._Vipers, Cobras, and Pythons are real-world examples of this type of creature.
7_15_Ancestral Knowledge_Your vision is engulfed in a thick fog. You hear the disembodied voice of the Ancestors say: “I am pointless, endless, and will go on forevermore. I bring countless futures lost, and end lives by the scores. What am I?_War_2_hint1_hint2